# ⚡ European Electricity Market Forecasting Engine

## AI-Based Intraday & Day-Ahead Electricity Market Forecasting Platform

Interactive Streamlit dashboard:

👉 https://industry-projects-wgbicqgzbudpdkrjmnnwbo.streamlit.app/

---

# Project Overview

The **European Electricity Market Forecasting Engine** is an end-to-end machine learning platform developed for electricity price forecasting across major European energy markets.

The project demonstrates the complete workflow of an energy analytics pipeline:

- Market data processing
- Data quality checks
- Feature engineering
- Machine learning forecasting
- Forecast validation
- Backtesting
- Model explainability
- Interactive dashboard development

The objective is to simulate a real-world energy analytics environment where market participants require accurate forecasts for:

- Trading decisions
- Market monitoring
- Risk assessment
- Forecast evaluation
- Portfolio optimization

---

