- Additional model artifacts

These files are not included in GitHub due to repository size and deployment constraints.

The GitHub version contains:

✅ Complete dashboard application  
✅ Forecasting framework  
✅ Feature engineering logic  
✅ Backtesting modules  
✅ Explainability components  
✅ Demo datasets for reproducibility  

The included demo files are representative datasets created to showcase the architecture, workflow and analytical capabilities of the platform.

