# System Architecture

The forecasting workflow follows a complete machine learning pipeline:

```
Market Data
      │
      ▼
Data Cleaning & Validation
(src/preprocessing)
      │
      ▼
Feature Engineering
(src/features)
      │
      ▼
Machine Learning Models
      │
      ▼
Forecast Generation
(src/forecasting)
      │
      ▼
Backtesting & Evaluation
(src/backtesting)
      │
      ▼
Explainability Analysis
(SHAP / Feature Importance)
      │
      ▼
Interactive Streamlit Dashboard
```

---

# Forecasting Framework

The platform supports two electricity market forecasting horizons:

## 1. Intraday Forecasting

Short-term forecasting designed for near real-time market analysis.

Includes:

- Recent market behaviour
- Price dynamics
- Lag features
- Rolling statistics
- Weather-related variables
- Market indicators


## 2. Day-Ahead Forecasting

Forecasting for next-day electricity market prices.

Includes:

- Historical price patterns
- Calendar effects
- Demand-related variables
- Renewable generation indicators
- Market seasonality

